てください！\n乃木坂から離れた答えだとありがたいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" \n持ち物チェック\n　\n□握手券\n□身分証明書\n(□トレード用の写真等)\n(□グッズ買うためのお金) \n□推しに対する愛 待ってます！  なかだかな"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-2265":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは☆彡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は４時半起きでお仕事、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"がんばりましたっヾ(●｀・ω・´●)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてレッスンが早く終わったので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夕方インフルエンザの予防接種を受けました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"腕がぁ～　腕がぁぁぁ～～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さっきテレビつけたらちょうどラピュタの最後のシーンやってました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おもしろい♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ムスカはまた今年も失礼なセリフを言って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして海に落ちていきました(｡・ε・｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は福岡のイベントですね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/icon/note.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中学生も３人出ます！がんばれ～中学生！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragr